        "name": "Quintin Smits",
        "email": "qd.smits@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-11-23T23:45:07Z"
      },
      "message": "Merge main into issue/1869-sketch-engrave-trace (generate.rs: keep sketch strokes and Do not touch)\n\nMain (#3349) split the Engrave arm to plan with trace_avoid. This branch\njoins the Trace and Engrave arms and adds the sketch-stroke path. The\njoined arm keeps both: a sketch pick rides its strokes; a model pick\nuses trace_avoid for Engrave with a Do not touch spec, and the plain\ntrace for Trace, which protect_path judges after fixture routing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
