      "committer": {
        "name": "Quintin Smits",
        "email": "qd.smits@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-11-23T23:45:12Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(app): judge sketch Engrave strokes against Do not touch\n\nA sketch Engrave rides open and closed strokes, which trace_avoid cannot\nplan around (it takes closed loops). The final path of a sketch Engrave\nnow goes through protect_path, as a Trace does: links are lifted and a\nstroke that meets a protected item is refused by name.\n\nPinned by sketch_engrave_trace::avoid::\ndo_not_touch_refuses_a_sketch_stroke_that_passes_too_near_a_protected_face\n(both Trace and Engrave).\n\nRefs #1869\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
